flowchart TD
    A[Owner + Pet + Task data] --> B[Scheduler.build_plan]
    B --> C{Conflicts or skipped tasks?}
    C -- No --> H[Display validated plan to user]
    C -- Yes --> D[Agent PLAN: LLM proposes JSON fixes]
    D --> E[Agent ACT: apply fixes to candidate plan]
    E --> F[Agent CHECK: re-run conflict + budget guardrails]
    F -- Pass --> H
    F -- Fail, attempts remain --> D
    F -- Max attempts exceeded --> G[AgentError: fall back to original plan + warning]
    H --> I[Human: pet owner reviews schedule in UI/CLI]